        "accession_number": "0001376339-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As discussed above, we are required to register with the FDA as an establishment that manufactures human cells, tissues, and cellular and tissue-based products.",
        "start_character": 52333,
        "end_character": 52493
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376339-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376339-26-000011-d64b8f58c919bbe2",
        "accession_number": "0001376339-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Beginning in 2024, we began commercializing a xenograft product, HELIOGEN, which is a 510(k)-cleared product manufactured by Regenity Biosciences, a contract manufacturer.",
        "start_character": 44383,
        "end_character": 44554
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376339-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376339-26-000011-d64b8f58c919bbe2",
        "accession_number": "0001376339-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Combining this data with feedback from exit interviews in any instances of voluntary employee turnover, we are able to use these actionable insights to improve employee engagement, provide opportunities for career development, evolve our total rewards offering and evaluate implementation of additional resources to enhance the employee experience at MIMEDX.",
        "start_character": 68140,
        "end_character": 68498
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376339-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376339-26-000011-d64b8f58c919bbe2",
        "accession_number": "0001376339-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Generally, the products we currently sell in the United States are regulated as Human Cells, Tissues, and Cellular and Tissue - Based Products (“HCT/Ps”), and are subject solely to Section 361 of the Public Health Service Act (“Section 361”) and related regulations, which do not require pre-market clearance or approval by the FDA.",
        "start_character": 43617,
        "end_character": 43949
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376339-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376339-26-000011-d64b8f58c919bbe2",
        "accession_number": "0001376339-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, in 2024, we broadened our portfolio and began offering animal-derived products, or xenografts, and in 2025 and early 2026, we entered into agreements with manufacturers of other wound care modalities to further expand our product offering to serve our large and growing customer base.",
        "start_character": 772,
        "end_character": 1065
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376339-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376339-26-000011-d64b8f58c919bbe2",
        "accession_number": "0001376339-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we market multiple sizes of EPIFIX, EPICORD and EPIEFFECT sheets for use as protective barriers, which enables a healthcare provider to select an appropriate size graft based on the size of the wound to reduce product waste.",
        "start_character": 11545,
        "end_character": 11782
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376339-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376339-26-000011-d64b8f58c919bbe2",
        "accession_number": "0001376339-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The majority of the products we currently manufacture and process are derived from human tissue.",
        "start_character": 43520,
        "end_character": 43616
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376339-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376339-26-000011-d64b8f58c919bbe2",
        "accession_number": "0001376339-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The products we sell are regulated by the FDA in the United States.",
        "start_character": 43452,
        "end_character": 43519
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376339-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376339-26-000011-d64b8f58c919bbe2",
        "accession_number": "0001376339-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To the extent we sell our products outside of the United States, we also are subject to laws and regulations of foreign countries.",
